          "guid": "mt2fiy0u1vfj3bsj",
          "message": {
            "text": "Playwright's locator.boundingBox() returns { x, y, width, height } — there is no left/top. An earlier draft asserted box.left (always undefined), which failed even though the popover was positioned correctly. Confirmed by logging the box: {x:40,y:125,width:49.5,height:32}. All three native browser specs pass on Chromium, including a <dialog> that stays hit-testable above a z-index: 99999 fixed bar (only the top layer can) and a native popover reporting :popover-open.",
            "markdown": "Playwright's `locator.boundingBox()` returns `{ x, y, width, height }` — there is no `left`/`top`. An earlier draft asserted `box.left` (always `undefined`), which failed even though the popover was positioned correctly. Confirmed by logging the box: `{x:40,y:125,width:49.5,height:32}`. All three native browser specs pass on Chromium, including a `<dialog>` that stays hit-testable above a `z-index: 99999` fixed bar (only the top layer can) and a native popover reporting `:popover-open`."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tests/browser/overlay.spec.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 195,
                  "endLine": 195,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  expect(box!.x).toBeGreaterThan(30);"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
